  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Runtime Dependencies\n- Bumped **Polyfill** to `11.0.1` (from `10.5.1`).\n- Bumped **Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives** to `10.0.10` (from `10.0.8`).\n- `MsExtensions` and the `EnhancedLinq` core: removed the implicit dependency on `DotExtensions` by inlining or replacing every call site (`DeferredMemoryIndexExtensions`, `ImmediateCountAtMostExtensions`, the various `ImmediateSegment*` and `DeferredSegment*` extensions, `ImmediateListNumberRangeExtensions`, etc.). Behavior is unchanged.",
